rements change so quickly  anyway you could spend hours on a  perfect solution only to have the  customer request something totally  different  this of course is the motivation behind  the agile Manifesto but more personally  it could mean that the work is  constantly kind of messy there aren't  clear unchanging rules for the software  we're building everything is Up For  Debate but in the end it's still a fun  job it's worth the difficult part but I  think we need to be more honest and open  about the challenges we face it's  certainly not an easy job but it does  have its Great Moments
 

